# The lit test room of the three-size review (docs/adr/0023 Decision 5; BUILD.md section 10,
# Pipeline, Review): a floor to stand on, a wall on the right to rake the ember across and to throw
# the asset's shadow on, a ledge above, and a crate on the left between the ember and the floor's
# far end. 20 x 12 tiles (640 x 384 u): the review crops 640 x 360 u of it. The asset stands on
# the mark (352, 320) with an ember 120 u to its left at chest height.
room lit_test
size 20 12
spawn 352 320
